# The calendar data of CLDR release 49 for every locale it holds, which
# `i18n/dates` reads: each locale's Gregorian month, day, quarter, day
# period and era names, its date, time and joining patterns, its
# skeletons, its relative times, its GMT formats and the names of UTC, and
# its numbering system; the digits of every numbering system; the first
# day and the minimal days of the week and the preferred hour of every
# region; the day period rules of every language.
#
# Every text is held once, in `STRINGS`: a hundred texts a chunk, separated
# by U+0001, text 0 the empty one. A block is a list of texts, each named
# by three characters of `ALPHABET`, its number in base 64.
#
# The table is data, made and not typed: a one-off Heroes program,
# `gen_dates.hero`, which is not in the tree (defect 2639), read CLDR 49's
# JSON (`cldr-49.0.0-json-full.zip` of
# https://github.com/unicode-org/cldr-json/releases, SHA-256 3b1f5d684d29c541,
# fetched 2026-11-18), its files `cldr-dates-full/main/*/ca-gregorian.json`,
# `dateFields.json` and `timeZoneNames.json`,
# `cldr-numbers-full/main/*/numbers.json`, and `cldr-core`'s
# `availableLocales.json` and `supplemental/numberingSystems.json`,
# `weekData.json`, `timeData.json` and `dayPeriods.json`, and wrote this
# module whole. Nothing here is edited by hand.

# The characters a text's number is written with.
constant ALPHABET: str
    "0123456789ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz+/"

# Every text, a hundred to a chunk.
constant STRINGS: [str]
    [
        "\u{1}илъэс\u{1}last year\u{1}this year\u{1}next year\u{1}+{0} y\u{1}-{0} y\u{1}Quarter\u{1}last quarter\u{1}this quarter\u{1}next quarter\u{1}+{0} Q\u{1}-{0} Q\u{1}мазэ\u{1}last month\u{1}this month\u{1}next month\u{1}+{0} m\u{1}-{0} m\u{1}тхьамафэ\u{1}last week\u{1}this week\u{1}next week\u{1}+{0} w\u{1}-{0} w\u{1}мафэ\u{1}yesterday\u{1}today\u{1}tomorrow\u{1}+{0} d\u{1}-{0} d\u{1}сыхьат\u{1}this hour\u{1}+{0} h\u{1}-{0} h\u{1}такъикъ\u{1}this minute\u{1}+{0} min\u{1}-{0} min\u{1}нэгъэупӏэпӏэгъу\u{1}now\u{1}+{0} s\u{1}-{0} s\u{1}щылэмазэм\u{1}мэзаем\u{1}гъэтхапэм\u{1}мэлылъфэгъум\u{1}жъоныгъуакӏэм\u{1}мэкъуогъум\u{1}бэдзэогъум\u{1}шышъхьэӏум\u{1}ӏоныгъум\u{1}чъэпыогъум\u{1}шэкӏогъум\u{1}тыгъэгъазэм\u{1}1\u{1}2\u{1}3\u{1}4\u{1}5\u{1}6\u{1}7\u{1}8\u{1}9\u{1}10\u{1}11\u{1}12\u{1}щылэмаз\u{1}мэзай\u{1}гъэтхапэ\u{1}мэлылъфэгъу\u{1}жъоныгъуакӏ\u{1}мэкъуогъу\u{1}бэдзэогъу\u{1}шышъхьэӏу\u{1}ӏоныгъу\u{1}чъэпыогъу\u{1}шэкӏогъу\u{1}тыгъэгъаз\u{1}тхьаумаф\u{1}блыпэ\u{1}гъубдж\u{1}бэрэскэжъый\u{1}мэфэкъу\u{1}бэрэскэшху\u{1}шэмбэт\u{1}S\u{1}M\u{1}T\u{1}W\u{1}F\u{1}Q1\u{1}Q2\u{1}Q3\u{1}Q4\u{1}AM\u{1}PM\u{1}BCE\u{1}CE\u{1}y MMMM d, EEEE"
